  "notable_quotes": [
    "Mn-N bonds in Mn-Tz are predominantly ionic, while Co-N and Zn-N bonds show distinct covalent character.",
    "Co-Tz and Zn-Tz are stabilized by more covalent frameworks up to 4.6 GPa, then transform to a less distorted monoclinic β-phase.",
